        <rdfs:label>correlated with</rdfs:label>
        <ns2:IAO_0000115>A relationship that holds between two entities, where the entities exhibit a statistical dependence relationship. The entities may be statistical variables, or they may be other kinds of entities such as diseases, chemical entities or processes.</ns2:IAO_0000115>
